OL,3,GNEWSAPigeon strung up like puppet in   
OL,4,A'horrific' attack                      
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains details 
OL,7,Fof animal abuse                        
OL,9,FA pigeon has made a full recovery after
OL,10,Fit was strung up and turned into a     
OL,11,Fliving puppet "like Pinocchio", an     
OL,12,Fanimal rescue charity has said.        
OL,14,FThe bird, which was found abandoned and
OL,15,Funable to move by a dog walker in      
OL,16,FJarrow, had its wings bound in tape and
OL,17,Fwas attached to a stick using fishing  
OL,18,Fwire.                                  
