OL,3,GNEWSAPigeon strung up like puppet in   
OL,4,A'horrific' attack                      
OL,6,FThe woman, who was alerted to the      
OL,7,Fstranded animal by her dog, brought the
OL,8,Fbird to Pawz for Thought in Sunderland 
OL,9,Fto be cared for.                       
